WEBVTT

00:15.057 --> 00:16.807
Earthys?

00:17.377 --> 00:18.937
They specifically requested us.

00:18.937 --> 00:20.557
Sweet! Let's do it!

00:20.557 --> 00:22.857
Now, hang on. Just listen first.

00:22.857 --> 00:23.817
Fine.

00:23.817 --> 00:28.127
That's the long-standing equipment
workshop in Qualto, right?

00:28.127 --> 00:30.217
My bow came from Earthys.

00:30.217 --> 00:32.327
Yeah. I know about them, too.

00:32.327 --> 00:34.917
And they chose us specifically?

00:34.917 --> 00:36.327
But why Clover?

00:36.787 --> 00:38.827
Probably because their
theme for the season...

00:39.377 --> 00:40.577
is this.

00:41.147 --> 00:44.067
"A new style for lady adventurers."

00:44.067 --> 00:47.217
"Set out on a new adventure
that's stylish yet safe."

00:47.217 --> 00:49.087
So it's to help promote this?

00:49.397 --> 00:54.117
You three will wear the latest armor
from Earthys to conquer a dungeon,

00:54.117 --> 00:56.597
and they'll use the footage for promotion.

00:56.597 --> 00:59.847
In other words, you'd be the
poster girls for their new line.

00:59.847 --> 01:02.187
What? Us?!

01:03.007 --> 01:04.687
We've gotta do it.

01:04.687 --> 01:07.357
It came from Yuke.
That's all I needed to know.

01:07.837 --> 01:09.247
Let's accept it, then.

01:09.247 --> 01:12.447
I particularly like this
part about the reward.

01:12.447 --> 01:16.447
"The armor you use to carry out
this quest is yours to keep."

01:16.447 --> 01:20.437
Oh, that's awesome!
We get both money and armor!

01:20.437 --> 01:22.437
We'll do it! We'll do it, Yuke!

01:22.437 --> 01:23.127
Yeah.

01:23.497 --> 01:24.677
Okay, then.

01:24.677 --> 01:31.197
"Conquer a dungeon in the latest armor
from Earthys" is Clover's next quest.

01:31.197 --> 01:32.297
Right!

01:32.297 --> 01:35.387
So... what's the dungeon
we have to conquer?

01:35.717 --> 01:39.387
It's a bit far, but it's in Qualto,
where Earthys is.

01:40.317 --> 01:42.417
The Aion Ruins Dungeon.

01:51.150 --> 01:58.110
(I Left My A-Rank Party to Help My Former
Students Reach the Dungeon Depths)

03:12.980 --> 03:17.317
(Episode 4:
Shadow Stalker)

03:17.317 --> 03:21.057
I came here with Thunder Pike a few
times when we were just starting out.

03:21.057 --> 03:22.537
Sorry for the wait, Yuke!

03:33.967 --> 03:35.447
Ta-da!

03:35.877 --> 03:37.747
Wh-What do you think?

03:37.747 --> 03:39.297
Do they suit us?

03:39.777 --> 03:42.807
You all look great! They're really cute!

03:45.437 --> 03:46.687
How do they feel?

03:46.687 --> 03:49.057
Light and easy to move in! I like it!

03:49.617 --> 03:51.647
And this new bow...

03:51.647 --> 03:54.187
I'm not used to it yet,
but I think I'll be fine.

03:54.537 --> 03:58.817
It's great. I love that these
pieces are all artifacts.

03:58.817 --> 04:00.697
They'll look great in streams!

04:00.987 --> 04:03.197
Just the thing for an artifact freak, huh?

04:04.837 --> 04:08.297
And they're paying us money
on top of giving us all this!

04:08.297 --> 04:10.017
They're so generous!

04:10.017 --> 04:11.707
Thanks, Earthys!

04:12.227 --> 04:15.087
Thank them after we finish the quest.

04:15.087 --> 04:17.077
This time, instead of a livestream,

04:17.077 --> 04:20.337
we'll be giving Earthys a
recording of our conquest.

04:20.337 --> 04:22.247
Let's have fun, but be careful.

04:22.247 --> 04:23.347
Recording started.

04:23.607 --> 04:24.457
Right!

04:27.800 --> 04:30.930
(Aion Ruins Dungeon, First Floor)

04:37.537 --> 04:40.657
The Aion Ruins Dungeon is fairly old.

04:40.657 --> 04:44.457
It's not very big, only four floors deep.

04:44.457 --> 04:44.530
The entrance to the main dungeon,

04:44.530 --> 04:46.780
(Aion Ruins Dungeon)
The entrance to the main dungeon,

04:46.780 --> 04:47.657
(Au Dread Abandoned City Dungeon)
The entrance to the main dungeon,

04:47.657 --> 04:49.660
(Au Dread Abandoned City Dungeon)
the Au Dread Abandoned City Dungeon,
is located at its deepest point.

04:49.660 --> 04:51.077
the Au Dread Abandoned City Dungeon,
is located at its deepest point.

04:51.077 --> 04:55.237
In other words, this is a passage to the
main dungeon that also functions as a dungeon.

04:55.907 --> 04:59.257
The quest objective is to reach
the Abandoned City Dungeon.

05:02.157 --> 05:06.907
There are stairways we can use to go
down at the eastern and western edges,

05:06.907 --> 05:08.137
so let's head there first.

05:08.587 --> 05:12.247
Wouldn't it be faster to drop down
through the atrium with a rope?

05:12.247 --> 05:14.517
Other people have thought
the same thing, but...

05:15.507 --> 05:16.397
Watch.

05:20.037 --> 05:22.127
It's likely because
it's become a labyrinth.

05:22.127 --> 05:25.517
Phase distortion prevents
anything from passing through.

05:25.517 --> 05:26.787
Don't fall, whatever you do.

05:27.147 --> 05:28.177
Right!

05:28.177 --> 05:29.287
Understood.

05:31.157 --> 05:33.637
Rain, did I do something wrong?

05:33.637 --> 05:36.177
You've seemed kind of angry
for a while now.

05:38.987 --> 05:42.047
She's not, Yuke. It's because
you didn't say anything.

05:43.047 --> 05:46.307
You just don't understand a
woman's heart, Master.

05:48.117 --> 05:51.437
You changed the color of your ribbon
to match the new armor, right?

05:52.117 --> 05:54.557
It really suits you. You look cute.

05:56.667 --> 05:58.067
H-Hey... What's wrong?

05:58.697 --> 06:00.467
You went too far, Yuke.

06:00.467 --> 06:03.117
Don't debuff her.

06:03.117 --> 06:05.027
That's right, Master.

06:06.527 --> 06:08.947
I'm okay now. Let's go.

06:10.667 --> 06:12.120
R-Right...

06:12.120 --> 06:15.620
(Second Floor)

06:16.877 --> 06:17.667
Ah.

06:18.207 --> 06:19.297
There's a trap.

06:20.677 --> 06:22.297
Stay back.

06:31.237 --> 06:33.637
Okay, it's safe now. Let's move on.

06:37.717 --> 06:38.647
All good?

06:39.397 --> 06:41.397
Yeah. We can fit through.

06:42.057 --> 06:45.657
Maybe it's good that this
new armor fits so snugly.

06:48.957 --> 06:50.837
The stairway's just ahead.

06:50.837 --> 06:52.577
Let's stop for a quick
meal when we get there.

06:53.007 --> 06:54.707
What kind of soup do we have today?

06:55.237 --> 06:58.447
That'll depend on the soup stock.

06:58.447 --> 07:00.457
I hope it turns out
to be one you like, Rain.

07:02.617 --> 07:04.407
No fair catering to Rain!

07:04.407 --> 07:06.497
It's gonna be one I like today!

07:06.497 --> 07:08.797
Personally, I like milk stew.

07:11.557 --> 07:12.697
Prepare for battle.

07:19.850 --> 07:23.350
(Orcs)

07:25.077 --> 07:26.527
Orcs!

07:28.407 --> 07:29.407
Silk!

07:29.847 --> 07:33.547
I know they say Orcs are the
archenemies of the elves,

07:33.547 --> 07:36.167
but you need to remain calm, okay?

07:36.167 --> 07:40.497
I know, but we must make
sure we eliminate them.

07:40.497 --> 07:42.167
We can't let a single one escape.

07:42.547 --> 07:46.647
Okay, there are four, and they're
dressed like low-ranked soldiers.

07:46.647 --> 07:49.037
They'd be considered C-rank monsters,

07:49.037 --> 07:51.177
but stay alert and assume
they're a step ahead.

07:51.947 --> 07:54.677
We'll strike first with magic and arrows.

07:54.677 --> 07:57.227
Then Marina will attack, and
Silk will provide backup.

07:57.227 --> 07:58.017
What about me?

07:58.017 --> 08:00.227
Hit the big one first.

08:00.227 --> 08:02.337
I want to reduce their
numbers as much as possible.

08:02.337 --> 08:03.647
Physical Enchant!

08:03.850 --> 08:05.350
(Enhanced Stamina, Enhanced Arm
Strength, Enhanced Leg Strength)

08:05.397 --> 08:08.407
Flames, rage like a furious beast...

08:08.407 --> 08:08.907
Ready?

08:09.417 --> 08:10.357
Always.

08:10.357 --> 08:11.077
Yes!

08:11.077 --> 08:11.527
Rain!

08:11.527 --> 08:13.887
...and burn the evil ones to ash!

08:13.887 --> 08:17.037
Grade 4 Magic: Fire Ball!

08:20.457 --> 08:23.467
Check! Scroll of Rock Blast!

08:32.437 --> 08:33.257
Two left!

08:33.587 --> 08:35.137
Paralyze! Slow!

08:35.970 --> 08:38.090
(Paralyze, Slow)

08:38.137 --> 08:39.647
Magic Blade!

08:50.657 --> 08:52.197
Just die already.

08:52.487 --> 08:53.697
Nice one, Silk!

08:54.137 --> 08:54.787
Finish it!

08:54.787 --> 08:55.757
Right!

09:04.787 --> 09:07.097
Okay, they're down.

09:07.097 --> 09:08.967
That worked out well.

09:12.457 --> 09:13.847
Have you calmed down a bit?

09:14.477 --> 09:16.597
Yes... I'm sorry.

09:16.597 --> 09:19.957
I just can't help becoming
enraged when I see Orcs.

09:19.957 --> 09:21.637
That's part of being an elf.

09:21.637 --> 09:22.857
Don't worry about it.

09:23.947 --> 09:27.987
You're not going to say,
"But you're a dark elf"?

09:28.417 --> 09:29.697
You're Silk, aren't you?

09:31.297 --> 09:36.057
The thing about dark elves betraying
the elves is just superstition.

09:36.057 --> 09:39.827
Besides, as far as I'm
concerned, we're on your side.

09:40.347 --> 09:42.077
Master...

09:42.357 --> 09:45.147
Rain's the one who said
it first, and look at her.

09:45.147 --> 09:48.217
You'd think she was a dwarf,
the way she loves artifacts.

09:48.217 --> 09:51.047
Rude! Artifacts are what
dreams are made of!

09:51.047 --> 09:52.087
I do get that.

09:54.377 --> 09:57.727
Yuke, the Orcs were carrying
something weird!

09:57.727 --> 09:58.967
Weird?

10:00.827 --> 10:01.847
This is...

10:02.517 --> 10:04.357
Great find, Marina.

10:04.607 --> 10:05.987
Is it?

10:05.987 --> 10:07.127
What is it?

10:07.127 --> 10:11.077
It's a bit damaged, but it's
a Memorandum of Revelation.

10:11.077 --> 10:13.157
Memorandum of Revelation?

10:13.157 --> 10:16.367
It's an artifact that can
uncover hidden abilities.

10:16.367 --> 10:20.367
Why would low-ranked monsters
like Orcs have that?

10:20.717 --> 10:22.247
Is it worth a lot?

10:22.247 --> 10:24.437
As it is now, not really,

10:24.437 --> 10:27.637
but it'd be a waste to sell it.
I'll repair it.

10:27.637 --> 10:28.857
You can do that?

10:28.857 --> 10:32.387
This is my time to show off
my skills as an Alchemist.

10:32.387 --> 10:34.887
If the repair works out,
one of you can use it.

10:35.167 --> 10:36.887
What happens when it's used?

10:37.317 --> 10:40.107
The user's talents grow a bit.

10:40.107 --> 10:43.467
For example, you might develop
the capacity for a second job

10:43.467 --> 10:45.377
or gain a new skill.

10:45.377 --> 10:46.897
I see...

10:46.897 --> 10:52.167
Then it's probably best for Marina to use it,
since she only has one job right now.

10:52.167 --> 10:52.737
Huh?

10:52.737 --> 10:54.907
Yeah. I agree with that.

10:55.377 --> 10:58.907
But will I really gain the
capacity for a second job?

10:58.907 --> 11:00.757
Sword Mages are rare,

11:00.757 --> 11:04.917
so they said at the temple that all my
potential might have gathered around it.

11:05.337 --> 11:07.477
That's one way to look at it,

11:07.477 --> 11:11.547
but even if it's not a job, you
might discover some hidden ability.

11:11.547 --> 11:13.047
Like as a bride?!

11:13.527 --> 11:15.887
Is that an ability?

11:17.727 --> 11:18.817
It's a chest.

11:20.557 --> 11:23.057
Charging...

11:26.427 --> 11:27.807
I'm happy for you, Rain!

11:28.267 --> 11:31.317
A Magic Bag is an awesome
prize to find in a chest.

11:31.317 --> 11:32.497
Yeah!

11:32.497 --> 11:35.147
But is it really okay for me to keep it?

11:35.537 --> 11:36.857
Of course!

11:36.857 --> 11:39.777
Isn't it best for someone with a
support role to have one of those?

11:40.197 --> 11:41.347
She's right.

11:41.347 --> 11:44.787
So the next time we find a
Magic Bag, Silk should use it.

11:45.097 --> 11:46.537
Are you sure?

11:46.847 --> 11:50.527
Of course. They're handy for
storing arrows, after all.

11:50.527 --> 11:53.167
Not that they're really
that easy to find...

11:53.577 --> 11:56.047
I won't get my hopes up, but
I'll enjoy the search.

11:58.487 --> 12:01.627
Okay, before we set out, let's
review our gains and losses.

12:01.627 --> 12:05.307
I only used one scroll,
and I'm good on mana.

12:05.607 --> 12:07.807
I'm good, too! Doing great!

12:08.307 --> 12:11.687
I used five arrows. I have 20 remaining.

12:12.037 --> 12:15.317
My belly and my mana reserves
are both full again.

12:15.717 --> 12:18.297
Good! Back to the quest, then.

12:18.297 --> 12:19.837
Let's have fun, but be careful.

12:21.230 --> 12:23.740
(Third Floor)

12:24.617 --> 12:27.497
We don't know where monsters
might attack from.

12:27.497 --> 12:28.657
Stay alert.

12:28.657 --> 12:30.787
So there are no floor bosses here?

12:31.547 --> 12:35.047
I heard there used to be at the
door to the Abandoned City Dungeon,

12:35.717 --> 12:38.797
but it hasn't been seen in
the past ten years or so.

12:38.797 --> 12:39.637
(Fourth Floor)

12:39.637 --> 12:45.827
I think it was written that multiple
Shadow Stalkers guarded the door.

12:45.827 --> 12:47.807
Shadow Stalkers?

12:47.807 --> 12:49.557
So they lurk in shadows?

12:49.877 --> 12:53.017
I've only read records.
I've never seen one.

12:53.017 --> 12:55.367
What kind of monsters are they?

12:55.367 --> 13:01.087
There are accounts saying they look like
solid black mannequins with shining eyes.

13:01.087 --> 13:02.047
Like that?

13:02.047 --> 13:02.657
Huh?

13:04.780 --> 13:07.280
(Shadow Stalker)

13:07.637 --> 13:09.367
A Shadow Stalker?!

13:09.367 --> 13:12.077
They haven't been seen in over ten years!

13:12.077 --> 13:13.707
Be sure to get a shot!

13:14.207 --> 13:15.927
Target locked.

13:17.037 --> 13:18.087
What shall we do?

13:18.417 --> 13:20.937
It feels pretty creepy
being watched like this,

13:20.937 --> 13:22.837
but the atrium can't be crossed,

13:22.837 --> 13:25.507
so I don't think it'll attack
us right away or anything.

13:29.797 --> 13:30.847
It got across!

13:33.937 --> 13:35.877
Here it comes! Prepare for battle!

13:35.877 --> 13:37.600
Check! Scroll of Multi-Enchant!

13:37.600 --> 13:38.600
(Piercing, Shield, Sharpness, Endurance)
Check! Scroll of Multi-Enchant!

13:43.457 --> 13:44.657
I'm ready anytime!

13:49.367 --> 13:50.367
Marina!

13:50.887 --> 13:52.247
What was that?!

13:52.247 --> 13:54.917
It shattered Multi-Enchant's
magic barrier?!

13:56.357 --> 13:57.287
Marina!

13:58.337 --> 14:00.927
God, heal the wounded ones!

14:00.927 --> 14:02.047
Healing!

14:05.137 --> 14:06.177
What did you do?!

14:10.937 --> 14:12.300
Is it coming?

14:12.347 --> 14:13.640
(Protection)
Protection!

14:18.167 --> 14:21.707
I get it! It destroys magic barriers!

14:21.707 --> 14:22.567
In that case...

14:24.067 --> 14:25.150
Blink Shadow!

14:25.150 --> 14:26.150
(Blink Shadow)

14:29.197 --> 14:30.437
Critical Weapon!

14:30.437 --> 14:31.707
Enchant Saint!

14:31.707 --> 14:32.660
Flame Scratch!

14:32.660 --> 14:34.660
(Critical Weapon,
Enchant Saint, Flame Scratch)

14:34.707 --> 14:35.457
Take this!

14:38.910 --> 14:40.267
(Curse)

14:40.267 --> 14:43.170
(Curse)
No... This is Dark Magic!

14:43.917 --> 14:45.657
This is hopeless, guys...

14:46.187 --> 14:47.467
Please get away...

14:47.927 --> 14:49.077
Yuke!

14:52.470 --> 14:53.100
(Wind Fury)

14:53.307 --> 14:56.647
Great one, please protect us!

14:56.647 --> 14:58.020
Holy Shield!

14:58.020 --> 14:59.520
(Holy Shield)

15:00.657 --> 15:02.067
Dryads...

15:07.137 --> 15:08.947
Why?! He isn't breathing!

15:08.947 --> 15:11.797
Rain! Focus on the enemy in front of—

15:13.747 --> 15:15.317
Silk, you okay?!

15:15.317 --> 15:16.387
Yes...

15:16.387 --> 15:18.587
Rain! Give Marina an Enchant Saint!

15:18.587 --> 15:21.957
Holy light, inhabit the
blade of the righteous!

15:21.957 --> 15:22.967
Enchant Saint!

15:23.670 --> 15:25.420
(Enchant Saint)

15:27.077 --> 15:28.217
It won't hold still!

15:28.217 --> 15:30.487
Then I'll use Wide-range Magic.

15:30.487 --> 15:35.847
Pebbles of ice, rain down from the sky
like comets and strike the evil ones!

15:35.847 --> 15:37.430
Grade 4 Magic: Ice Gravel!

15:37.430 --> 15:38.810
(Ice Gravel)
Grade 4 Magic: Ice Gravel!

15:40.597 --> 15:42.107
It disappeared?! Where—

15:43.717 --> 15:45.737
Marina! I'll use Healing Magic right—

15:46.857 --> 15:48.287
You two...

15:52.867 --> 15:53.990
It's still so...

15:53.990 --> 15:55.740
(Eclipse Cannon)

15:59.370 --> 15:59.417
(Scroll of Light Shield)

15:59.417 --> 16:01.580
(Scroll of Light Shield)
Scroll of Light Shield!

16:04.667 --> 16:05.417
Master!

16:05.417 --> 16:06.757
Yuke!

16:07.037 --> 16:07.250
Are you all right, Master?!

16:07.250 --> 16:08.590
(Body Double Protection)
Are you all right, Master?!

16:08.590 --> 16:09.017
Are you all right, Master?!

16:09.017 --> 16:11.960
You've got a lot of nerve
hurting my partymates!

16:11.960 --> 16:12.437
(Snare)

16:12.437 --> 16:14.090
(Snare)
1,000 Snares!

16:16.957 --> 16:20.147
Paralyze! Slow! Collapse!
Blindness! Venom! Chains!

16:20.640 --> 16:21.720
(Slow, Paralyze, Blindness,
Venom, Collapse, Chains)

16:22.137 --> 16:23.027
Gravity!

16:24.980 --> 16:27.480
(Heal)

16:28.107 --> 16:30.417
Grade 4 Spiritual Magic:

16:33.360 --> 16:33.717
(Ivy Maiden)

16:33.717 --> 16:34.990
(Ivy Maiden)
Ivy Maiden!

16:35.037 --> 16:36.537
Magic Blade!

16:40.427 --> 16:43.507
Guide them to peace in the heavens above!

16:43.507 --> 16:44.667
Turn Undead!

16:54.297 --> 16:55.927
That was amazing, Yuke!

16:56.907 --> 17:00.057
Y-Yeah? I'm just...
glad you're all okay...

17:00.057 --> 17:03.347
Yuke, Marina is a girl coming of age.

17:03.347 --> 17:04.907
You shouldn't hug her too long.

17:04.907 --> 17:07.537
H-Hey! I'm not the one doing it!

17:07.537 --> 17:08.447
Oh! Sorry!

17:09.787 --> 17:12.717
Anyway, I can't believe
it jumped down like that.

17:12.717 --> 17:15.947
If you hadn't spotted it, I would've
been hit by a surprise attack.

17:16.307 --> 17:17.827
It was just luck!

17:18.217 --> 17:19.837
Still, thanks.

17:20.547 --> 17:22.457
Rain, what did you make of that thing?

17:22.847 --> 17:25.607
It was undead,
but its mana was in disarray.

17:25.607 --> 17:27.457
I don't think it's something
that should exist.

17:28.057 --> 17:29.137
I thought so.

17:29.667 --> 17:31.327
It shouldn't have been
able to pass through

17:31.327 --> 17:33.857
that impassable atrium to
travel between floors.

17:34.937 --> 17:36.097
This looks a lot like...

17:36.487 --> 17:37.847
...an Overflow.

17:40.327 --> 17:42.277
Master, what should we do?

17:42.277 --> 17:43.977
We're on the bottom floor.

17:43.977 --> 17:45.557
Let's finish the quest first.

17:45.557 --> 17:47.937
Should we let everyone
know with a livestream?

17:48.417 --> 17:50.777
You're all wearing armor that
hasn't been made public yet.

17:50.777 --> 17:53.797
I'd rather not livestream
without the client's consent.

17:53.797 --> 17:55.577
If we do, it'll be a last resort.

17:55.577 --> 17:59.447
Right... It's still just
something kinda weird.

17:59.927 --> 18:03.267
We'll report to the Adventurer's Guild
in Qualto once the quest is done

18:03.267 --> 18:05.317
and have them build a team to investigate.

18:05.317 --> 18:10.857
I'm sure Earthys won't mind the guild
watching our footage for investigative purposes.

18:10.857 --> 18:11.967
Okay, let's get going.

18:12.427 --> 18:13.977
Wait, Yuke.

18:16.717 --> 18:18.907
Let me heal your wounds.

18:18.907 --> 18:22.047
This is not the time to rush things. Right?

18:22.687 --> 18:25.227
God, heal the wounded ones.

18:25.227 --> 18:26.517
Healing.

18:31.717 --> 18:33.947
I understand your concern,

18:33.947 --> 18:37.527
but we're proper adventurers now, too.

18:38.217 --> 18:39.997
You're right. Sorry.

18:40.357 --> 18:42.997
Don't bear everything alone.
It's not good.

18:43.377 --> 18:44.057
Right.

18:45.157 --> 18:46.247
Right.

18:46.247 --> 18:48.397
Everyone, check your gains and losses.

18:48.397 --> 18:51.257
I only lost a bit of mana. I'm fine.

18:51.257 --> 18:53.237
No problems for me, either.

18:53.237 --> 18:54.637
I'm good, too!

18:55.237 --> 18:56.857
No problems here.

18:56.857 --> 18:58.167
Refresh Mana.

19:02.467 --> 19:03.887
Thanks, Yuke.

19:04.507 --> 19:06.257
Thank you for the healing.

19:09.397 --> 19:12.647
So this is the deepest part
of the Aion Ruins Dungeon?

19:13.717 --> 19:17.277
And this is the entrance to the
Au Dread Abandoned City Dungeon.

19:17.277 --> 19:19.277
It looks... pretty impressive.

19:19.837 --> 19:23.447
It's said that the Abandoned City Dungeon
part is where people once lived,

19:23.447 --> 19:27.787
and the ruins here used to be a
building full of different shops.

19:27.787 --> 19:31.217
What's inside Au Dread, then?

19:31.217 --> 19:35.227
It's our job as adventurers to find out.

19:35.227 --> 19:38.047
It's one of the dungeons that
hasn't been traversed yet.

19:38.377 --> 19:43.197
Which means there may be an
Abyss Gate at its deepest point.

19:43.197 --> 19:44.517
It's possible.

19:44.517 --> 19:45.557
Really?

19:45.557 --> 19:49.397
Yeah. Some say Abyss Gates are
artifacts built by people

19:49.397 --> 19:52.387
of an ancient civilization to
allow passage to other worlds.

19:52.387 --> 19:54.797
So they might be in various locations.

19:54.797 --> 19:57.897
Oh, I get it! You're so smart, Rain!

19:59.307 --> 20:03.077
Okay, we just need to touch this
door, and the quest is complete.

20:06.280 --> 20:08.780
(Qualto Adventurer's Guild)

20:10.317 --> 20:12.707
I've made my report. Good work, everyone.

20:12.707 --> 20:15.607
You did more work than any of us.

20:15.607 --> 20:16.587
You must be exhausted.

20:17.017 --> 20:19.587
Nah, this is nothing!

20:20.387 --> 20:21.507
What did the guild say?

20:21.507 --> 20:24.747
I reported our quest completion,
footage submission,

20:24.747 --> 20:27.797
and the Shadow Stalker's existence.

20:27.797 --> 20:29.817
They might want to interview us,

20:29.817 --> 20:33.647
so let's take the next two days off, like
we planned, and stay here in Qualto.

20:33.947 --> 20:36.817
I'm in! Let's all go on a date together!

20:36.817 --> 20:38.767
I'm not familiar with this town,

20:38.767 --> 20:41.237
so I'd appreciate it
if you'd show me around.

20:41.237 --> 20:44.657
I want to go see all the
artifacts with Yuke, too!

20:45.227 --> 20:49.427
Okay. If they call us for an interview,
they'll want all four of us, anyway.

20:49.427 --> 20:51.107
Let's all go sightseeing tomorrow.

20:51.107 --> 20:54.217
Sweet! I wanna go to a
place that has good food!

20:54.217 --> 20:57.207
I'd like to visit the botanical
garden this town is known for.

20:57.207 --> 21:00.037
I want to go to the artifact bazaar!

21:00.037 --> 21:03.237
I'm not sure we can do
all that in one visit...

21:03.237 --> 21:06.407
Okay, let's come up with
a plan over dinner.

21:06.407 --> 21:09.707
There's a place just ahead that
serves great chicken dishes.

21:09.707 --> 21:11.807
You're always on top of things, Yuke!

21:12.927 --> 21:14.087
Leave it to me.

21:14.087 --> 21:17.527
Post-adventure support
is part of my job, too!

21:21.987 --> 21:23.426
That was so silly!

21:23.427 --> 21:24.607
- It was!
- Okay, let's go!

22:56.030 --> 22:57.617
(Mission)

22:57.617 --> 22:59.517
(Mission)
Next time, "Mission."

22:59.517 --> 23:01.040
(Mission)
